    "body": "### Describe the bug\n\nI think there is a regression that come in via #7783 /  95c0c67fe2083031c387cbdefb5853e5623dc96b \n\n\n\n```\n@ cython -3 fail.pyx\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/bin/cython\", line 6, in <module>\n    sys.exit(setuptools_main())\n             ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Main.py\", line 821, in setuptools_main\n    return main(command_line = 1)\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Main.py\", line 849, in main\n    result = compile(sources, options)\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Main.py\", line 740, in compile\n    return compile_multiple(source, options, cache)\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Main.py\", line 699, in compile_multiple\n    result = compile_single(source, options, full_module_name=options.module_name, cache=cache, context=context)\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Main.py\", line 670, in compile_single\n    return run_pipeline(source, options, full_module_name, context)\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Main.py\", line 566, in run_pipeline\n    err, enddata = Pipeline.run_pipeline(pipeline, source)\n                   ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Pipeline.py\", line 418, in run_pipeline\n    data = run(phase, data)\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Pipeline.py\", line 400, in run\n    return phase(data)\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Pipeline.py\", line 50, in generate_pyx_code_stage\n    module_node.process_implementation(options, result)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/ModuleNode.py\", line 314, in process_implementation\n    self.generate_c_code(env, options, result)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/ModuleNode.py\", line 614, in generate_c_code\n    self.body.generate_function_definitions(env, code)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Nodes.py\", line 437, in generate_function_definitions\n    stat.generate_function_definitions(env, code)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Nodes.py\", line 5714, in generate_function_definitions\n    self.body.generate_function_definitions(self.scope, code)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Nodes.py\", line 437, in generate_function_definitions\n    stat.generate_function_definitions(env, code)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Nodes.py\", line 2326, in generate_function_definitions\n    self.generate_function_body(env, code)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Nodes.py\", line 2079, in generate_function_body\n    self.body.generate_execution_code(code)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Nodes.py\", line 443, in generate_execution_code\n    stat.generate_execution_code(code)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Nodes.py\", line 8417, in generate_execution_code\n    except_clause.generate_handling_code(code, except_end_label)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Nodes.py\", line 8648, in generate_handling_code\n    self.body.generate_execution_code(code)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Nodes.py\", line 443, in generate_execution_code\n    stat.generate_execution_code(code)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Nodes.py\", line 8750, in generate_execution_code\n    self.body.generate_execution_code(code)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/Nodes.py\", line 443, in generate_execution_code\n    stat.generate_execution_code(code)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/UtilNodes.py\", line 330, in generate_execution_code\n    self.setup_temp_expr(code)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/UtilNodes.py\", line 230, in setup_temp_expr\n    self.temp_expression.generate_evaluation_code(code)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/ExprNodes.py\", line 889, in generate_evaluation_code\n    self.generate_subexpr_evaluation_code(code)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/ExprNodes.py\", line 904, in generate_subexpr_evaluation_code\n    node.generate_evaluation_code(code)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/ExprNodes.py\", line 6770, in generate_evaluation_code\n    super().generate_evaluation_code(code)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/ExprNodes.py\", line 889, in generate_evaluation_code\n    self.generate_subexpr_evaluation_code(code)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/ExprNodes.py\", line 904, in generate_subexpr_evaluation_code\n    node.generate_evaluation_code(code)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/ExprNodes.py\", line 895, in generate_evaluation_code\n    self.generate_result_code(code)\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/ExprNodes.py\", line 15358, in generate_result_code\n    self.result(), self.arg.result_as(self.ctype())))\n                   ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/ExprNodes.py\", line 582, in result_as\n    return typecast(type, self.ctype(), self.result())\n                                        ~~~~~~~~~~~^^\n  File \"/home/tcaswell/.virtualenvs/cp315/lib/python3.16/site-packages/Cython/Compiler/ExprNodes.py\", line 3781, in result\n    return self.cname\n           ^^^^^^^^^^\nAttributeError: 'RawCNameExprNode' object has no attribute 'cname'\n```\n\n### Code to reproduce the behaviour:\n\nA minimal reproducer is\n\n```\n\"\"\"Cython-coded implementation of wrapper module\"\"\"\n#cython: language_level=3\n\ncdef class Test:\n    cdef object test( self ):\n        try:\n            return 1/0\n\n        except Exception as err:\n            err.args += ('a', 'c')\n            # cythonizes fine\n            # err.args = err.args + ('a', 'c')\n            raise\n\n```\n\n\n### Expected behaviour\n\n_No response_\n\n### OS\n\nlinux\n\n### Python version\n\n3.15 (main branch)\n\n### Cython version\n\nmaster branch after 95c0c67fe2083031c387cbdefb5853e5623dc96b \n\n### Additional context\n\n I bisected the issue back to this commit and found it in the wild at https://github.com/mcfletch/pyopengl/blob/4d084dbd7c956a3b06c3ef027b11a7884737475d/accelerate/src/wrapper.pyx#L63-L70\n\nThis code cythonizes with 3.2.9 and changing `err.args += (...)` -> `err.args = err.args + (...)` cythonizes with the master branch.",
