            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the report, just in time before our upcoming beta release.\n\nIt's also related to https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/7505 which added C property setters. We now use C properties for exception attributes and there clearly wasn't a test for bringing in-place assignments into that mix.",
