            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Here's a shorter reproducer for `ext_attr_setter.pyx`:\n```python\ndef test_assign_obj_inplace(o):\n    \"\"\"\n    >>> test_assign_obj_inplace((1, 2))\n    Exception(1, 2)\n    >>> test_assign_obj_inplace(())\n    Exception()\n    \"\"\"\n    e = Exception()\n    e.args_obj += o\n    return e\n```\n\nI'll try to rewrite the C property setter code using regular attributes. That should avoid this issue.",
